## Limits and cross-task facts

This is P3 review only. P4 historical integration, final broad review, and actual 662-file archive/56-file evaluator preservation verification remain outside this diff. The prior P2 independent-review hash is referenced by the implementer's authority but that prior review was not re-audited here; the retained exact P2 source is the comparison authority. No tests, synthetic behavior/probes, source imports, historical reader or summary execution, credentials/environment values, provider/evaluation/Docker/campaign activity, git mutations, or archive edits were performed. Only this review report was written during actual review. Static findings and future static approval do not imply executed policy-positive behavior.
